    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t01-mother-02-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第2题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t01-mother-02",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26北京）运输公司派出一批货车运输一批货物，每车每次运5吨正好3次运完，如果增加6辆车，每车每次多运1吨，正好2次运完。则原来有多少辆车？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "54"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "36"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "24"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "18"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "C",
        "sourceAnswer": "C"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          30
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          24
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s03-t01-mother-02-p030.webp",
            "alt": "和差倍比问题（三） · 母题精讲2 · 讲义第24页",
            "pdfPage": 30
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t01-mother-02-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s03-t01-mother-02",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：C"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先抓两种方案运的是同一批货。设原来n辆车，第一种方案总运输量为n×5×3；第二种车数n+6，每车每次6吨，运2次。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "15n=12(n+6)\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad n=24"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "核验第一种24×5×3=360吨，第二种30×6×2=360吨，正好相等，所以选C。新增6辆不能写成只派6辆。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "同一总工作量的不同方案，分别写“数量×单次效率×次数”后令其相等。"
        }
      ],
