    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t01-mother-03-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第3题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t01-mother-03",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（25广东事考）某地教育部门计划向当地各小学发放学习材料，如果每所小学分配6套材料，则剩余70套材料，如果每所小学分配8套材料，则缺40套材料，则当地共有（）所小学需要发放材料。",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "40"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "55"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "70"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "85"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          30
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          24
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s03-t01-mother-03-p030.webp",
            "alt": "和差倍比问题（三） · 母题精讲3 · 讲义第24页",
            "pdfPage": 30
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t01-mother-03-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s03-t01-mother-03",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先比较两种分配方案。每所从6套增加到8套，多分2套；原来剩70套，后来还缺40套，相当于总需求多了70+40=110套。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "学校数=\\frac{70+40}{8-6}=55"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "核验材料总数为6×55+70=400套，若每所8套需要440套，确实差40套，所以选B。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "一剩一缺的分配题，总差是剩余加缺口，再除以每份差。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
